From: NFCSTORE CI <ci@nfcstore.uz>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 05:53:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 44/53] Nova (iPhone): Premium obunasi Apple In-App Purchase
 orqali (StoreKit 2)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- in_app_purchase_storekit 0.4.8+1 (+ platform_interface 1.4.0) — faqat
  StoreKit plagini; Android'ga Play Billing / BILLING ruxsati qo'shilmaydi.
- IapStore interfeysi (StoreKit 2 ustida), IapRepository (/api/iap/apple/
  config, account-token, verify), IapController: JWS serverga, 200 dan
  keyingina completePurchase; tarmoq xatosida tranzaksiya ochiq qoladi.
  Kirgan foydalanuvchida purchaseStream ilova ochilishidan tinglanadi.
- /premium ekrani: App Store narxi va davri, obuna, tiklash, Apple 3.1.2
  matni, EULA va maxfiylik havolalari, kutilayotgan / faol holatlar.
- Kirish yo'li faqat iPhone + server kaliti yoqilganda: Sozlamalar va
  biznes katalogi kartasi. Kalit o'chiq / Android — bugungi xulq.
- iPhone'da Premium obunachiga 10 ta profil qo'shig'i (server bilan bir).
- Sinovlar: test/iap_premium_test.dart (24 ta).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
